    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitor is a multiplayer social thriller based on suspicion and strategy. Players assume roles, gain trust, cooperate... until someone betrays them. In each round, one is the secret killer and the others try to survive. Observe, interrogate, gather evidence and uncover the real killer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836580/extras/2fb920c5684c59bfcc2eef2307f3cd06.avif?t=1753985485\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate every other player without getting caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blend in, stay unnoticed, and use disguises if necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust no one \u2014 and let no one escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836580/extras/890b5bd4e1ce0d47a7dfc567d517554b.avif?t=1753985485\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and eliminate the traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 if you shoot an innocent, you\u2019ll drop your weapon and lose it for a short time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One mistake can cost the whole game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836580/extras/237f368f2b206871bef1c3a265ea0825.avif?t=1753985485\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather the clues the traitor left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully investigate your surroundings and connect the dots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your job to uncover the killer\u2019s identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836580/extras/237f368f2b206871bef1c3a265ea0825.avif?t=1753985485\" width=800 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the house for weapon parts to build your only defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay alert and protect yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You never know who might turn on you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
